<title>USA: ADT says will review Western offer.</title>
<headline>ADT says will review Western offer.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>ADT Ltd said it will review an unsolicited $3.5 billion acquisition offer from Western Resources Inc in due course and suggested shareholders await a recommendation from its board.</p>
<p>Western, which holds 27 percent of ADT, earlier announced a cash and stock offer that values ADT at $22.50 per share.</p>
<p>((--Robin Sidel, 212/859-1723))</p>
</text>
